{"id":844643,"title":"42｜搭建Coze文生图工作流","content":"本节课介绍了如何使用扣子平台创建文生图工作流。首先，登录扣子官网，在资源库中新建一个名为“text to image”的工作流，描述为用户输入文本提示词生成图片。进入编辑界面后，通过添加图像生成节点连接开始和结束节点，形成完整流程。配置图像生成节点时，选择通用模型并设置生成比例与质量，默认负向提示词避免不当内容生成，正向提示词引用用户输入变量。完成配置并通过试运行验证效果后，发布工作流。利用扣子API执行工作流前需申请个人访问令牌，并获取工作流ID。在API调用页面填写相关参数，包括令牌、工作流ID及JSON格式的提示词，最终返回生成图片的URL。本课程展示了从创建到调用整个文生图工作流的过程。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397565,"user_name":"Geek_1f1305","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4070972,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"9DB753C72422B0","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738943137,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144254,"content":"抱歉，本课程不会讲这部分内容了。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1738983156,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397565,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"大神，可以教学一下Dify工作流DSL使用Cursor设计吗？谢谢！","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656858,"discussion_content":"抱歉，本课程不会讲这部分内容了。","content_length":16,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1738983156,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}